OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALeader denies parking charge hike
OL,4,Ais 'cash cow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, speaking on BBC Radio Merseyside,
OL,7,Fcouncil leader Liam Robinson said there
OL,8,Fwere strict rules about how the money
OL,9,Fcould be spent, and that the additional
OL,10,Frevenue would be invested in parking
OL,11,Fenforcement.
